0" lrx="1027" lry="651" /><zone xml:id="m-33a797a8-9e5e-499c-a958-f23f0021623f" ulx="128" uly="641" lrx="1026" lry="675" /><zone xml:id="m-52e9f865-b1db-4099-9e32-81fa30ea59a4" ulx="130" uly="672" lrx="1021" lry="708" /><zone xml:id="m-05d76327-5cba-457c-9cd0-1d1398d89472" ulx="127" uly="696" lrx="575" lry="734" /><zone xml:id="m-0d5c2dbb-d32e-44b5-b5ac-56a546e14c63" ulx="581" uly="699" lrx="686" lry="734" /><zone xml:id="m-94630621-3bfa-4967-9b8f-071d438d8063" ulx="127" uly="727" lrx="583" lry="764" /><zone xml:id="m-0b3b80f2-1173-42c1-b54a-b30410dccfaf" ulx="528" uly="769" lrx="629" lry="806" /><zone xml:id="m-c65ba499-ad5c-4642-a5e1-e592010b645c" ulx="168" uly="807" lrx="1026" lry="847" /><zone xml:id="m-dd50f3e0-df26-479e-9a52-89a51ea010e2" ulx="132" uly="837" lrx="573" lry="875" /><zone xml:id="m-54875727-427c-4945-91e3-d6ec9c3995ee" ulx="582" uly="841" lrx="1025" lry="872" /><zone xml:id="m-14631e38-8f61-4bec-a2bc-1cc541062c40" ulx="126" uly="866" lrx="571" lry="899" /><zone xml:id="m-32a41ba9-8fec-473a-b59e-1e1b160d246f" ulx="582" uly="872" lrx="968" lry="902" /><zone xml:id="m-d276331b-ac56-402f-8cb7-c0f1fc16b977" ulx="126" uly="893" lrx="574" lry="929" /><zone xml:id="m-4b174f44-57ce-47de-a0a5-248ee5719d02" ulx="453" uly="938" lrx="700" lry="972" /><zone xml:id="m-d7c0b7a7-6816-4ce5-884f-a42bf9393d40" ulx="171" uly="972" lrx="1023" lry="1014" /><zone xml:id="m-c8b4f2e1-edec-4db6-a62c-58150fbaa3f3" ulx="127" uly="1003" lrx="566" lry="1042" /><zone xml:id="m-9d880b3e-fa8a-45ee-a63b-c55c02970cc1" ulx="583" uly="1008" lrx="1025" lry="1039" /><zone xml:id="m-2213fa7e-e871-4b11-85cc-370e7f862636" ulx="130" uly="1031" lrx="1021" lry="1070" /><zone xml:id="m-ea962b60-78f7-4010-a869-ad21973250b4" ulx="126" uly="1058" lrx="1023" lry="1100" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-4be53167-36f3-4095-8a9f-108604b99975" n="1498" facs="#m-ad8a36da-afe8-4d53-b30c-34703bfadd8c" /><div xml:id="m-20d4e0e9-d82d-47b7-b590-9f808f380656">
            <lg xml:id="m-d01538e5-975d-409d-b5bf-550c11f9fd48">
              <l xml:id="m-2c860734-9cc2-4194-b193-f68780e5e711" facs="#m-2543c2f8-65c9-4eca-8080-f16930133700" label="ambiguous">1298</l><l xml:id="m-91ff634b-0876-40f2-bb00-3660d48a46c9" facs="#m-9b9b98ea-952a-488d-bdfb-ebdd50067738" label="text-like">Mass of Thanksgiving.</l><l xml:id="m-0be07725-a3cd-47de-ba57-04c0c829d350" facs="#m-981ca1ad-8a33-49f0-97ea-2227f1ea97f1" label="lyrics-like">ptum coram Salvatóre nostro Deo, (ípsum pro ómnibus, testimónium</l><l xml:id="m-0dfca45a-4157-45bd-bf36-044bdf41779d" facs="#m-0b70f2d7-f49e-4c22-a4ca-02a378ea18cb" label="lyrics-like">tempóribus suis: in quo pósitus</l><l xml:id="m-2965e8e4-5e2d-431d-9235-1523754302de" facs="#m-6bd94383-5f16-47a7-86c7-6a97990e5ff5" label="lyrics-like">qui omnes hómines vult salvos fieri,</l><l xml:id="m-9e8fcab8-ad7e-4767-8632-7d1b853dd056" facs="#m-cc58e972-88c5-4b3f-a162-cd23f98d8cd5" label="lyrics-like">sum ego praedicátor et apõstolus</l><l xml:id="m-e18dea47-7dd3-478a-8fa9-84e0f5ea3a0c" facs="#m-4a8d3d3b-fa71-42e4-baa8-51449c101f88" label="lyrics-like">et ad agnitiónem veritátis venire.</l><l xml:id="m-b885942d-5854-4086-b4c5-2c1ec31d315c" facs="#m-841ce206-eb03-41a2-a95f-c2c4c29a25fd" label="lyrics-like">(veritátem dico, non méntior) doctor</l><l xml:id="m-c7504cf7-f84f-49fc-a9fa-226282749599" facs="#m-22cbf497-61cd-414b-a750-b0326c61b529" label="lyrics-like">Unus enim Deus, unus et mediátor</l><l xml:id="m-d8104b59-c816-4d3c-a91e-f41f4237fdba" facs="#m-55755829-68c0-4b61-a6b9-11e164817b32" label="lyrics-like">géntium in fide et veritâte.</l><l xml:id="m-f54b51b1-fbc4-4f5a-87c7-b3d9e3fefba7" facs="#m-0cdebb90-ad54-4580-a510-030ae5288d3e" label="lyrics-like">Dei et hóminum, homo Christus Je¬</l><l xml:id="m-9cf25c04-287b-47d2-8255-4daf86392954" facs="#m-725e1e33-42f9-49f6-aca6-1a9afd814b55" label="lyrics-like">sus: qui dedit redemptiónem semet¬</l><l xml:id="m-eca9005d-8096-4768-b968-56b2da165351" facs="#m-4921750b-8f29-4a9a-89d6-4415f2edb33f" label="text-like">Mass of Thanksgiving.</l><l xml:id="m-e2e61526-4d43-416d-8922-bcf9dc5bc897" facs="#m-801b9741-ae92-4b17-bfca-d5721299284f" label="text-like">The Mass said is that of the Blessed Trinity, of the Holy Ghost, ot the</l><l xml:id="m-df0512da-2240-4202-b47b-7ed831fe0658" facs="#m-ea59f131-565a-4237-b7ca-45030bbb2cfb" label="text-like">Blessed Virgin Mary, or of any canonised Saint whose name is found in the</l><l xml:id="m-bbcfbc9a-b201-42b4-8f2f-0e31ae52be20" facs="#m-b9301f42-55c9-4f10-884d-ba94f45f93f5" label="text-like">Roman Martyrology. The following Collect, Secret, and Posicommunion</l><l xml:id="m-4b860c3e-1a6f-4987-bbdd-2f4359c073ff" facs="#m-a35a256a-9b5c-4c7a-b60a-063487adb9db" label="text-like">are added to those proper to the Mass with only one conclusion, even in</l><l xml:id="m-fc3b3b74-898e-4b4f-b61b-8b2939e82ecb" facs="#m-02d0a3c4-463a-4756-b811-957fc8e9771d" label="ambiguous">private Masses.</l><l xml:id="m-88ae67d8-7882-4340-82fd-5546ced1cd33" facs="#m-e0050f29-ea34-494a-ade0-58dc4c05ad0e" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-881e791b-7b48-49b3-a078-558d545b7b20" facs="#m-ba2828d0-e621-4a9f-ad65-405fa3e64d9d" label="lyrics-like">Eus, cujus misericórdiae non est! rántes; ut qui peténtibus postuláta</l><l xml:id="m-fef64cbf-9f80-4ded-a6b3-5e256b3a122e" facs="#m-33a797a8-9e5e-499c-a958-f23f0021623f" label="lyrics-like">U númerus, et bonitátis infinitus ! concédis, eosdem non déserens, ad</l><l xml:id="m-44b40afb-8608-43f5-a61d-b78b7107d03e" facs="#m-52e9f865-b1db-4099-9e32-81fa30ea59a4" label="lyrics-like">est thesáurus : piíssimae majestáti ] praémia futúra dispónas. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-588260e5-5f1a-40c4-9b92-98510430c0c5" facs="#m-05d76327-5cba-457c-9cd0-1d1398d89472" label="lyrics-like">tuae pro collátis donis grátias ági¬</l><l xml:id="m-5886aa4f-ea99-4200-87ad-cf657fe2edcc" facs="#m-0d5c2dbb-d32e-44b5-b5ac-56a546e14c63" label="ambiguous">minum.</l><l xml:id="m-89db802c-5b5f-4b86-92cb-c1ca402bd782" facs="#m-94630621-3bfa-4967-9b8f-071d438d8063" label="lyrics-like">mus, tuam semper cleméntiam exo¬</l><l xml:id="m-55d46f3b-2935-4ca8-9300-572ce6241dac" facs="#m-0b3b80f2-1173-42c1-b54a-b30410dccfaf" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-a0fdd57a-bfc4-4cb0-bcd1-5732f1df121b" facs="#m-c65ba499-ad5c-4642-a5e1-e592010b645c" label="lyrics-like">Dorem Dómine sacrificii hujus  ab omni in pósterum adversitáte</l><l xml:id="m-a6e38b5e-1622-494a-aa4b-a141fbd5c5dd" facs="#m-dd50f3e0-df26-479e-9a52-89a51ea010e2" label="lyrics-like">U cum gratiárum actiónibus sús¬</l><l xml:id="m-5966126f-b11c-443c-a1ae-1c895247f166" facs="#m-54875727-427c-4945-91e3-d6ec9c3995ee" label="lyrics-like">custódias; et in tuo servitio et amó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b7d14490-f1e6-484b-a8fd-16139d367a00" facs="#m-14631e38-8f61-4bec-a2bc-1cc541062c40" label="lyrics-like">cipe, et praesta : ut quos exaudíre,</l><l xml:id="m-22eaa1e3-59db-4c28-b464-c73c632d9704" facs="#m-32a41ba9-8fec-473a-b59e-1e1b160d246f" label="lyrics-like">re concréscant. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-f5f32bb7-7543-4e8a-b168-fcbbb15f8ec0" facs="#m-d276331b-ac56-402f-8cb7-c0f1fc16b977" label="lyrics-like">et incólumes serváre dignátus es,</l><l xml:id="m-8df881e4-4583-44c2-b0c2-30a9caa75d9b" facs="#m-4b174f44-57ce-47de-a0a5-248ee5719d02" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-51461ac5-2801-4645-b2a5-099e1cc544b1" facs="#m-d7c0b7a7-6816-4ce5-884f-a42bf9393d40" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui néminem in te sperán-[ votisque suscéptis grátias ágimus,</l><l xml:id="m-a02e5a98-f68e-4914-8140-9b1984aeee53" facs="#m-c8b4f2e1-edec-4db6-a62c-58150fbaa3f3" label="ambiguous">U tem nimium affligi permittis,</l><l xml:id="m-8d8d8b6a-7d5b-47aa-925b-06072b404b9b" facs="#m-9d880b3e-fa8a-45ee-a63b-c55c02970cc1" label="lyrics-like">te piissime deprecántes : ut per haec</l><l xml:id="m-84ef469a-6d22-4a19-8f18-1b1c03874d37" facs="#m-2213fa7e-e871-4b11-85cc-370e7f862636" label="lyrics-like">sed pium précibus praestas audí- quae súmpsimus, a cunctis éripi</l><l xml:id="m-995cd484-ebf2-4a53-a634-5e4a39efb387" facs="#m-ea962b60-78f7-4010-a869-ad21973250b4" label="lyrics-like">tum: pro postulatiónibus nostris ! mereámur advérsis. Per Dóminum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>